# Mobile design lock (Premium soft)

## Source of truth

**Look and feel:** `RaphCare.Mobile/Resources/Styles/` and `Core/Common/Controls/`. Doc: **`docs/Mobile_Concept_Port.md`**.

**Architecture / DI / features:** **`.cursor/rules/raphcare-mobile.mdc`**.

## Do

- Prefer shared Premium soft tokens for new or polished UI.
- Avoid one-off colors in page XAML when a style key exists.
- Keep the screen inventory in **`docs/Mobile_Concept_Port.md`** when adding or retiring screens.
- Wire Shell, ViewModels, Client, Kernel per **`.cursor/rules/raphcare-mobile.mdc`**.

## Do not

- Treat the old React Vite mockup (`C:\laragon\www\raphcare-mobile-app-concept`) as a visual target.
- Sync MAUI colors, type, radii, or shadows from that mockup’s CSS or Tailwind config.
- Mark screens done based on mockup pixel parity.

## Archive note

The Vite app was an early layout sketch. It is optional historical reading for old screen names only. Prefer the MAUI screen map in **`docs/Mobile_Concept_Port.md`**.
